# Retro churn-cost price sheet (#3776): per-million token rates are
# owner-configured and never committed -- the repo ships only the zeroed
# price_sheet.example.json. CI reads rates from the CHURN_PRICE_SHEET_JSON
# repo variable; this entry keeps a local sheet from being committed.
/scripts/retrospective/data/price_sheet.json
